cts landing on its vines.",0,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["say","avg1_133","When its food becomes scarce,==W== it shapeshifts into suitably-sized creatures it has touched to relocate for food.==W== That's why it's called \"mimic.\"",0,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["goon"],["say","avg1_133","Regular mimic vines are harmless to Trekkers, but this Garden of Parasite one overgrew.==W== The magic mist that once helped it escape now serves as a weapon for hunting.",0,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["ctl","avg2_976","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["hide","avg2_976",0.5],["ctl","avg1_133","a","003",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["stg",0,null,null,1.2,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["w",1],["mrt",1,"y","014",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Now I understand.==W== It's still following its basic mimic vine nature. Therefore...",1,""],["mrt",0,"y","003",null,"daintou"],["goon"],["mrt",0,"y","013","idea",null],["say","avg3_100","Light at night signals food,==W== drawing the monster toward it!",1,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_133","a","002",null,null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_133","Precisely. We're using the cabin as a lure.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","010","sweaty",null],["say","avg3_100","You've mapped this out since the beginning? And here I thought you'd just charge in alone.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["show","avg2_977","a","004",0.4,null,null,0,null,0.0],["stg",0,120.0,-50.0,1.35,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,"Zhong"],["ctl","avg1_133","a","014",null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["tsk","Zhong"],["fx",0,"fx_speedline_center_w",0,0],["se","se_070"],["ctl","avg2_977","a",null,null,0.35,null,null,0.8,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["say","avg1_133","I'm no==W== Spirit of Brutality!==W==",0,""],["se","se_314"],["goon"],["w",1],["goon"],["ctl","avg2_977","a",null,null,0.3,null,null,0.0,null,"OutQuart",1.0],["hide","avg2_977",1.0],["ctl","avg1_133","a","029",null,null,nu